oundness and description quality\n- Examining related work contextualization\n- Reviewing evaluation methodology and empirical support for claims\n\nHowever, the actual **scoring rubric with numerical scales and specific evaluation dimensions is not presented** in this publicly available section.\n\n## Recommendation\n\nTo obtain the complete scoring criteria, reviewers would need to access the full \"Instructions for AAAI-26 Reviewers\" document, which is linked as a Google Doc in the page but whose complete contents are not displayed in the webpage excerpt provided.","durationMs":4283,"url":"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/instructions-for-aaai-26-reviewers/"}}
