{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0178FPm7X4G1F6N2D8J4MDEk","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0519/projects/nlp_variance_gtheory/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# nlp_variance_gtheory — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-21 07:49 UTC | 更新原因: exp-001 全部完成 + Dream #3 分析完成 + framing 更新 + 防御性分析 9/9\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nG-theory 应用于 LLM 评测方差分解：量化 item、model×item 交互、方法学因素的相对贡献，提供 benchmark-specific 可复现性预算。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **阶段**: Research → 准备进入论文写作（等 re-dream #4 验证）\\\\n- **exp-001 全部完成**: 4 models (Llama/Gemma/Mistral/Qwen) × MMLU × 345,600 records\\\\n- **核心发现**: item_id=42.1%, model×item=33.6%, G_item=0.820, D-study 预测验证 Δ=0.004\\\\n- **防御性分析 (9 项全部完成)**:\\\\n  - Bernoulli 非假象 (737.5×) ✅\\\\n  - Fixed/random 不敏感 (<5% shift) ✅\\\\n  - Bootstrap=jackknife (ratio 0.96-1.04) ✅\\\\n  - 温度分层 (G: 0.76→0.55) ✅\\\\n  - D-study 公式验证 + 单调性 ✅\\\\n  - IRT vs G-theory (3.6-4.4× gap) ✅\\\\n  - REML vs Henderson I (<0.5pp) ✅\\\\n  - BF16-vs-FP16 sensitivity (precision→0.0006% without FP32) ✅\\\\n  - Leave-one-model-out (G_item spread=0.023) ✅\\\\n- **Dream #3**: Best 6.5/10, Median 3/5, Worst 5/10 — 结构性问题已识别并修正 framing (D006)\\\\n- **paper_framing.md**: 已更新 4-model 数据 + Dream #3 framing 修正 (8 项指令)\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] Re-dream #4 验证更新后 framing（正在启动）\\\\n- [ ] LOMO matched-spec 重跑（论文如需绝对值比较时执行）\\\\n- [ ] 准备 exp-002 基础设施（数据下载 GSM8K/ARC/HellaSwag, benchmark configs）\\\\n- [ ] Re-dream 通过后 → 启动 Paper Agent 论文写作\\\\n- [ ] 5 张图制作（stacked-bar, design diagram, D-study curves, IRT comparison, temp heatmap）\\\\n- [ ] exp-002 multi-benchmark 实验审批（~200h GPU，P0，等 re-dream 通过）\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- 分配: westd-32570 cuda:0-3 (4× RTX PRO 6000 96GB)\\\\n- 当前: 0/4 使用中（exp-001 完成，等 re-dream 后启动 exp-002）\\\\n- exp-002 预估: ~200h GPU (4 models × 4 benchmarks × reduced design)\\\\n- AAAI DDL: Jul 28 (9 weeks), 时间充裕\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D006 | 2026-05-21 | Dream #3 分析完成：三档 borderline，但 4-model 实际数据超越 dream | exp001_qwen, exp001_llama, exp001_gemma, exp001_mistral |\\\\n| D005 | 2026-05-21 | Gemma2 fp16 不可用 — cross-model 分析用 bf16+fp32 平衡设计，f | exp-001 |\\\\n| D004 | 2026-05-21 | Re-dream #2 通过质量门控（Best 4/6, Median 4/6），批准 exp-00 | exp-001 |\\\\n| D003 | 2026-05-20 | Dream 审稿后调整 framing：infrastructure crossing 降级为 co | exp-001, exp-004 |\\\\n| D002 | 2026-05-20 | 采用 dual-metric (binary correct + text exact match) | — |\\\\n| D001 | 2026-05-20 | MVP PASS — G-theory 方差分解在 LLM 评估中可行，item 方差主导（58.4 | — |\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2170, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01CLeRy69Xs1yjsxu6QVhpMi","session_id":"2badbab1-f12e-49d2-a949-e349aaeb2aba","uuid":"3f710fc1-190f-4111-8bdd-b2b7ac64a247","timestamp":"2026-05-21T08:40:45.696Z"}
